{"id":"steam-1055040","steam":1055040,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Teleball","summary":"Teleball is a VR game that lets you do everyone's favorite thing in VR, throw stuff! Use 8 powerful Teleballs to teleport around environments with more than 60 obstacles, traps, and more! Teleball is designed with accessibility in mind, everyone's invited to come check out our balls!","about":"Teleball is the world's first first-person Virtual Reality platformer! Throw Teleballs to navigate over 30 environments dodging over 60 traps, obstacles, and more! \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\nFeatures:\n\r\n\n\r\n•  Designed from the ground up for accessibility and VR friendliness!\r\n•  30+ levels each adding new mechanics across 6 different zones!\r\n•  Use 8 different Teleballs to navigate environments and avoid over 60 obstacles and traps!\r\n•  Try to beat the developer's time trials and par scores to earn secret levels and mechanics!\r\n•  Customize your experience to suit your needs with sliders for strength and ease-of-use features tailor-made for VR!\r\n•  Accessibility features like colorblind mode, left-handed mode, and fear-of-heights mode!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055040/library_600x900.jpg?t=1715623302","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055040/header.jpg?t=1715623302","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055040/library_hero.jpg?t=1715623302","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055040/header.jpg?t=1715623302","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055040/ss_0927261216ad0de35c402531b3902b901d655347.600x338.jpg?t=1715623302","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055040/ss_0927261216ad0de35c402531b3902b901d655347.jpg?t=1715623302"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass